<title>UK: UK's West Merchant names Briance CEO.</title>
<headline>UK's West Merchant names Briance CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Merchant Bank Holdings Ltd, the British unit of Germany's Westdeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale, said on Friday it had appointed Richard Briance as chief executive of WestMerchant Group.</p>
<p>Briance succeeds Patrick Macdougall on June 2, WestMerchant said in a statement.</p>
<p>WestMerchant Group includes West Merchant Bank and Panmure Gordon &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
